                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \hat H^\bullet(M)
            combines the ordinary cohomology
            %math#mathml_43c142bd26492806eb706aa0500abcb194dae6d7_3.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
