                    %mo *
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \tilde E^*
            are naturally isomorphic
          %p such that if required to be compatible with integration the ismorphism is unique
          %p
            if
            %math#mathml_43c142bd26492806eb706aa0500abcb194dae6d7_53.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
