                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \hat E, \tilde E
            are multiplicative, then this isomorphism is, as well.
          %p
            %strong example
            if we don’t require compatibility with
            = succeed "-integration," do
              %math#mathml_43c142bd26492806eb706aa0500abcb194dae6d7_54.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
