          %h2#bunke_smooth_ktheory Bunke: smooth K-theory
          %p (I gave up taking notes in that one, maybe somebody else has notes?)
          %h2#costello_part_ii Costello, part II
          %p alternative to yesterday’s axioms:
          %p
            replace
            %math#mathml_43c142bd26492806eb706aa0500abcb194dae6d7_56.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
